-## Looking at your spending
+Supported currencies: EUR, GBP, INR, JPY, SGD, USD. Amounts are converted to
+USD at the rates in `tally/rates.py` and stored as dollars. The original amount
+and currency are kept alongside for reference.
 
-The `report` command prints category totals for a month. You can narrow it to a
-single category too:
+### report — category totals for a month
 
 ```
-python -m tally.cli report --month 2024-03
-python -m tally.cli report --month 2024-03 --category food
+tally report [--month YYYY-MM] [--category NAME]
